>> title: Cooklang Pancakes
>> servings: 4
>> time: 20 minutes
>> course: Breakfast
>> tags: quick, breakfast, cooklang

Whisk the @flour{200%g}, @milk{300%ml}, @eggs{2} and a pinch of @salt together
in a #mixing bowl{} until smooth.

Melt a little @butter{1%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} over medium heat.

Pour in a ladle of batter and cook for ~{2%minutes} until bubbles form, then
flip and cook the other side for ~{1%minute}.

Serve warm with @maple syrup{} and fresh @berries{}.
